# The Connoisseur’s Instinct

Which of the three are the Connoisseurs talking about? Two (imagined) conversations: along the top, how it looks and what it’s made of; along the bottom, the ideas behind it. Click anyone to hear them – each goes deeper as it goes. One guess a round; hear them all out and the work’s story is yours.

